{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-02/1065768/block/singleImage/3278343/wm/01KGJ10N277HBXQ9RJF4WKJ7QT.JPG?updatedAt=1795618764\"/><figcaption>伊利沙伯醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>黃大仙竹園南邨貴園樓保安周三下午4時14分報案指，發現一名男子倒臥在大廈對開。人員接報到場，25歲陳姓內地男子昏迷被送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救，經初步調查相信男子從大廈走廊墮下，警方在場沒有檢獲遺書，案件列作「有人從高處墮下」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:44:24.487937+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:59:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:57:10.830338+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T16:37:39.629094+00:00","content_hash":"d0d62429140a94239a189aaf607f37e38c3086ed1ea677f632d285b633069a10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T16:44:24.487937+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}